data: {"id": "43aa4de3887843e0-thinking-parallel_evidence-169", "run_id": "43aa4de3887843e0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "首轮可观测性结果已给出。Metrics (Prometheus) 为空，说明 kube-state-metrics 尚未采集到该 Pod 的指标（通常因为 Pod 状态异常或 ksm 刷新延迟）；Logging (ES) 有 2 条记录，分别是 \"SIGTERM received; waiting\" 和 \"application started\"，表明应用收到了终止信号并在等待；Tracing (DeepFlow/Tempo) 为空，无 L7 流量或 Span 记录。\n\n接下来执行核心 Kubernetes 诊断计划：获取 Pod YAML 以确认真实状态（deletionTimestamp, finalizers）、获取 Events 以查找终止阻塞原因、并确认节点状态。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789370769606, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

