data: {"id": "43aa4de3887843e0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1014", "run_id": "43aa4de3887843e0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "关键事实已齐全：\n1.  **Pod 状态**：`kubectl get pod` 显示 `STATUS: Terminating`，`AGE: 63s`。尽管 YAML 中 `containerStatuses.ready=true`，但 K8s 整体状态已转为 Terminating，说明删除流程已启动。\n2.  **节点状态**：`node2` 为 `Ready`，排除了节点故障导致的卡死。\n3.  **Finalizers**：`<none>`，排除了 finalizer 阻塞。\n4.  **时间与原因**：\n    *   `deletionTimestamp`: `08:30:20Z`。\n    *   `deletionGracePeriodSeconds`: `3900` (65分钟)。\n    *   `AGE`: `63s` (相对于观察时间)。\n    *   日志显示应用收到 `SIGTERM` 后打印 \"waiting\"，因为它在等待 `/state/teardown-requested` 文件。\n    *   事件中有 `Killing` (50s前)。\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789370784429, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

